                     {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$+\\,C,\\,$ where $C$ is an arbitrary constant." 13194139533791 true] [17592186251486 1113 #uuid "1dfafc71-b5a1-5763-aa25-a630d5a7ea69" 13194139533791 true] [17592186251486 1145 "We combine the sum and the constant multiple rules, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4f(x)+3g(x))\\text{d}x & =\\int (4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{e}^{x}+3(8x-\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{3}))\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2{e}^{x}+24x-2{x}^{3})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int {e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x+24\\int x\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int {x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{e}^{x}+24\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}+C \\\\  & =2{e}^{x}-\\frac{{x}^{4}}{2}+12{x}^{2}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant." 13194139533791 true] [17592186251487 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251488 13194139533791 true] [17592186251487 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533791 true] [17592186251487 1041 "field-1" 13194139533791 true] [17592186251487 1104 #edb/ref 17592186251488 13194139533791 true] [17592186251487 1110 #uuid "3634d3ab-fcde-5241-b1db-c7927325b764" 13194139533791 true] [17592186251488 1034 "2e^x+12x^2-\\frac{1}{2}x^4" 13194139533791 true] [17592186251488 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533791 true] [17592186251488 1111 #uuid "2f5a7be5-e731-5c05-8986-72ef7af326a2" 13194139533791 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-167324" 17592186251465 "q-167324/field-1" 17592186251466 "q-167324/field-1/d77d44b5097fbbe3c31cbf999f370b945404caabad4bde6b6b7b7c7c9bcdc4d2" 17592186251467 "q-167325" 17592186251468 "q-167325/field-1" 17592186251469 "q-167325/field-1/0957ec6d647e436213b95fce4d94f342dc6791f310a648804db4c9a4218a432b" 17592186251470 "q-167326" 17592186251471 "q-167326/field-1" 17592186251472 "q-167326/field-1/b68a68812063c0a1cdcf9f8770320fc0d10d82d3ab8b244a3b8b827c108a94cc" 175921